        <content fontSize="13" fontFamily="微软雅黑" color="rgba(43, 47, 54, 1)" lineSpacing="multiple:1.8">
          <p><strong>RRF 融合</strong></p>
          <p>score = 1/(60+向量名次) + 1/(60+BM25名次)</p>
          <p>不依赖原始分数，只看排名</p>
        </content>
