        </content>
      </shape>
      <shape width="400" height="120" topLeftX="60" topLeftY="160" type="text" id="bGB">
        <content fontSize="13" fontFamily="微软雅黑" color="rgba(43, 47, 54, 1)" lineSpacing="multiple:1.8">
          <p>· RRF 融合取 Top 8 候选</p>
          <p>· Rerank 逐对计算 query-doc 相关性分数</p>
          <p>· 本地：bge-reranker-base</p>
          <p>· 在线：gte-rerank-v2</p>
        </content>
      </shape>
      <shape width="400" height="28" topLeftX="500" topLeftY="125" type="text" id="bGJ">
        <content fontSize="15" fontFamily="微软雅黑" color="rgba(230, 0, 18, 1)" bold="true">
          <p>阈值过滤：拒绝不相关</p>
        </content>
      </shape>
      <shape width="400" height="120" topLeftX="500" topLeftY="160" type="text" id="bGC">
        <content fontSize="13" fontFamily="微软雅黑" color="rgba(43, 47, 54, 1)" lineSpacing="multiple:1.8">
          <p>· Rerank 分数 &lt; 0.3 的块直接丢弃</p>
          <p>· 资料不足时回答「无法回答，请转人工」</p>
          <p>· 避免硬凑不相关资料导致 LLM 瞎编</p>
        </content>
      </shape>
      <shape width="840" height="130" topLeftX="60" topLeftY="320" presetHandlers="8" type="rect" id="bGX">
        <fill>
          <fillColor color="rgba(245, 246, 248, 1)"/>
